        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-4">
        <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">روابط هامة</h5>
        <ul class="list-unstyled p-0">
          <li class="mb-2"><a href="/" class="text-secondary text-decoration-none small">🏠 الرئيسية</a></li>
          <li class="mb-2"><a href="/books" class="text-secondary text-decoration-none small">📖 الكتب</a></li>
          <li class="mb-2"><a href="/about" class="text-secondary text-decoration-none small">ℹ️ حولنا</a></li>
          <li class="mb-2"><a href="/contact" class="text-secondary text-decoration-none small">📞 اتصل بنا</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-4">
        <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">تواصل معنا</h5>
        <p class="text-secondary small mb-2">
          <i class="bi bi-envelope text-primary me-2"></i> book.house@gmail.com
        </p>

        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-md-start gap-2 mt-3">
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-info rounded-circle"><i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i></a>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-info rounded-circle"><i class="fab fa-facebook"></i></a>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-info rounded-circle"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-info rounded-circle"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="my-4 border-secondary opacity-50">

    <div class="text-center small text-secondary pb-4">
      © <span id="year"></span> جميع الحقوق محفوظة لدى
      <span class="text-primary fw-bold">بيت الكتب</span>
